OL,3,GNEWSABus lane to reopen to taxis       
OL,4,Adespite traffic warning                
OL,6,FA bus lane is set to be reopened to    
OL,7,Ftaxis despite the council previously   
OL,8,Fsaying that doing so would lead to more
OL,9,Ftraffic.                               
OL,11,FGateshead Council said the section of  
OL,12,FAskew Road that approached the Tyne    
OL,13,FBridge, which was made bus-only in     
OL,14,F2020, would be reopened to taxis and   
OL,15,Fprivate hire vehicles from early       
OL,16,FDecember.                              
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
