OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABus lane to reopen to taxis       
OL,4,Adespite traffic warning                
OL,6,FReform UK councillor Graham Keating    
OL,7,Fsaid the administration was also       
OL,8,Fseeking to open the road to all other  
OL,9,Fvehicles. This is despite the fact the 
OL,10,Flocal authority had previously said its
OL,11,Fmodelling had suggested reopening the  
OL,12,Froad to others would increase          
OL,13,Fcongestion.                            
OL,15,FThe local authority, and the council's 
OL,16,FReform leadership, did not respond to  
OL,17,Fquestions about this U-turn.           
